    "All banner text was separately typeset in English; previous posters with Japanese lettering are not included.",
    "Existing user-approved AI-generated mascot artwork was cropped, resized and composited. No new character pose was generated for this pack.",
    "The connection mark is a new simple geometric supporting mark based on the approved motif, not a copied icon-library asset.",
    "No source PNGs, font files, copyrighted third-party icon sets, build outputs or repository code snapshots are bundled.",
    "File checks validate the shipped bytes, not character identity, legal ownership, or text detected by OCR."
